{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S09把“想在难受时有人陪”进一步解释成“孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，比Y更替人物下判断，心理动机显得稍微过满。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的话语有【】作为视觉锚点，观众不必逐字读完就能抓住每段的心理转折；感受词又按音乐节点出现，不容易一次被大量短词淹没。它把人物的怀念、委屈、孤独、犹豫和逐渐自我接纳串成了连续的心理过程，同时用舞步、呼吸、音色、节奏和身体感受具体呈现变化，比Y单纯罗列情绪词更容易让观众感到细腻而真实。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9ba78c2d-1885-4900-be70-139c644fdfa7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T012030339889Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.516, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:21:48.878538+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "aa1c7c417610e49e5bbd6841df5b9a494e4ba1032bd2d9ef8ad09aa1d349d0ca", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000